set {
name = “service.type”
value = “LoadBalancer”
}
set {
name = “service.annotations”
value = “service.beta.kubernetes.io/aws-load-balancer-type: nlb”
}
}
This will install NGINX and deploy a Kubernetes service for NGINX running under the namespace
we specified. The next step is to configure an ingress for our application:
resource “kubernetes_ingress_v1” “ingress” {
metadata {
name = “${local.web_app_name}-ingress”
namespace = var.k8s_namespace
annotations = {
“kubernetes.io/ingress.class” = “nginx”
}
}
spec {
rule {
http { ... }
}
}
}
